@startuml
!include skin.iuml
title Bagian 3: Enkapsulasi

class Brand {
  -name : String
  -country : String
  --
  +Brand(name : String, country : String)
  +getName() : String
  +getCountry() : String
  +getInfo() : String
}

class Car {
  -plate : String
  -model : String
  -year : int
  -available : boolean
  --
  +Car(plate : String, model : String, year : int)
  +getPlate() : String
  +getModel() : String
  +setModel(model : String) : void
  +getYear() : int
  +setYear(year : int) : void
  +isAvailable() : boolean
  +rentOut() : boolean
  +returnVehicle() : void
}
note right of Car
  Tanpa setPlate dan setAvailable.
  setModel: tolak null/kosong/spasi.
  setYear: tolak tahun di bawah 1990.
  IllegalArgumentException, nilai lama tetap.
end note

class Customer {
  -customerId : String
  -name : String
  -rentalCount : int
  --
  +Customer(customerId : String, name : String)
  +getCustomerId() : String
  +getName() : String
  +setName(name : String) : void
  +getRentalCount() : int
  +canRent() : boolean
  +addRental() : boolean
  +returnRental() : boolean
}
note right of Customer
  Batas 2 sewa aktif.
  Tanpa setCustomerId dan setRentalCount.
end note
Brand -[hidden]down-> Car
Car -[hidden]down-> Customer
@enduml
